<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Pendaftaran Mahasiswa Baru TA 2026/2027</title>
    <style>
        body { font-family: 'Segoe UI', Arial, sans-serif; margin: 0; padding: 0; background-color: #f4f6f9; color: #333; line-height: 1.6; }
        header { background-color: #1a365d; color: white; padding: 20px 0; border-bottom: 4px solid #d69e2e; }
        .container { width: 85%; max-width: 1100px; margin: auto; overflow: hidden; padding: 0 20px; }
        nav { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; }
        nav h1 { margin: 0; font-size: 24px; }
        nav ul { list-style: none; padding: 0; display: flex; margin: 0; }
        nav ul li { margin-left: 20px; }
        nav ul li a { color: white; text-decoration: none; font-weight: bold; }
        main { display: block; margin: 40px auto; }
        .hero { background: linear-gradient(rgba(26,54,93,0.8), rgba(26,54,93,0.8)), url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1523050854058-8df90110c9f1?w=1000') no-repeat center center/cover; color: white; text-align: center; padding: 50px 20px; border-radius: 8px; margin-bottom: 30px; }
        .hero h2 { font-size: 32px; margin-bottom: 10px; }
        .grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 2fr 1fr; gap: 30px; }
        article { background: white; padding: 25px; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.05); margin-bottom: 20px; }
        article h3 { color: #1a365d; margin-top: 0; border-bottom: 2px solid #edf2f7; padding-bottom: 10px; }
        aside { background: white; padding: 25px; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.05); height: fit-content; }
        aside h3 { color: #d69e2e; margin-top: 0; }
        .btn { display: inline-block; background-color: #d69e2e; color: white; padding: 12px 25px; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 5px; font-weight: bold; margin-top: 15px; }
        .btn:hover { background-color: #b7791f; }
        footer { background-color: #2d3748; color: white; text-align: center; padding: 20px 0; margin-top: 40px; font-size: 14px; }
        @media(max-width: 768px) { .grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } nav { flex-direction: column; } nav ul { margin-top: 15px; } }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <header>
        <div class="container">
            <nav>
                <h1>Universitas Informatika Global</h1>
                <ul>
                    <li><a href="#">Beranda</a></li>
                    <li><a href="#">Alur & Syarat</a></li>
                    <li><a href="#">Kontak</a></li>
                </ul>
            </nav>
        </div>
    </header>

    <main class="container">
        <section class="hero">
            <h2>Penerimaan Mahasiswa Baru TA 2026/2027</h2>
            <p>Bergabunglah bersama prodi S1 Informatika membangun masa depan teknologi cerdas.</p>
            <a href="#" class="btn">Daftar Sekarang</a>
        </section>

        <div class="grid">
            <section>
                <article>
                    <h3>Jalur Seleksi Beasiswa Unggulan</h3>
                    <p>Jalur ini dibuka bagi siswa berprestasi akademik maupun non-akademik dengan fasilitas bebas biaya kuliah penuh selama 8 semester. Pendaftaran gelombang pertama dibuka hingga 30 Juni 2026.</p>
                </article>

                <article>
                    <h3>Persyaratan Dokumen Administrasi</h3>
                    <p>Calon mahasiswa wajib menyiapkan scan rapor semester 1-5, kartu identitas (KTP/Kartu Pelajar), serta pas foto terbaru berlatar belakang merah.</p>
                </article>
            </section>

            <aside>
                <h3>Kontak Helpdesk</h3>
                <p>Mengalami kendala saat pengisian formulir? Hubungi tim kami via WhatsApp:</p>
                <p><strong>+62 812-3456-7890</strong></p>
                <p>Jam Kerja: 08.00 - 16.00 WIB</p>
            </aside>
        </div>
    </main>

    <footer>
        <p>&copy; 2026 Universitas Informatika Global. All Rights Reserved. Standar Struktur Semantik HTML5.</p>
    </footer>

</body>
</html>
